Apple today released the first public betas of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a> and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipados-27/">iPadOS 27</a>, allowing anyone with a compatible device to download and test the new software.<br/>
<br/>
